  "<size=25>Little Mermaid's Song <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Preparation time: 8 Actions\\nGive all allies <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield for $3 turns, and restore $4 SP. When the Shield breaks, decrease your cooldown by $5 action.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Under the gentle protection of the sea, the little mermaid shows off her dance steps and delivers the blessing of the sea to all her companions.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=27>Poseidon's Blessing Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=27>Poseidon's Blessing <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Preparation time: 8 Actions\\nGive 1 ally <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield, and decrease their Weak DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. Give the target $5 Down Points and $6 stacks of <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The melody of the sea and the dance of destiny will stop all attempts to harm the little mermaid.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Tide of Dreams Lv.$1": "",
  "Tide of Dreams <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Preparation Time: 12 Actions\\nGive all allies <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> + <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link> stack * (<color=#FFFC40>$3</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>) Shield for $5 turns; If [Seashell] is ≥ $6 stacks, each stack of [Nereids's Guard] increase that allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns; They lose the DMG Dealt buff and $9 stacks of [Nereids's Guard] when the Shield expires or breaks.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Dreams will eventually dissolve into bubbles......? No, all the obstacles will only make our stage more colorful!</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=29>Whispering Waves Lv.$1</size>": "",
