  "Guardian of the Sea": "",
  "Every time you give Shield, that ally permanently gain $1 stack of [Seashell], each stack increase Shield Received by $2, up to $3 stacks.\\nAllies with [Seashell] gain the following effect based on their stack amount (Change when reaching level 1, 50, 70):\\n$4 stacks: Increase DEF by $5/$6/$7.\\n$8 stacks: Increase ATK by $9/$10/$11.\\n$12 stacks: Increase DEF by $13/$14/$15.": "",
  "Marionette Dance": "",
  "At the start of battle, all allies gain $1 stack of <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link>.": "",
  "Self-Reliance": "",
  "For my Big Bro!": "",
  "When any ally's HP is below $1, immediately give them $2 DEF + $3 Shield for $4 turns, once per battle.": "",
  "Street Performer": "",
  "Chasing Dreams": "",
  "After any ally uses HIGHLIGHT/{{B}}, give that ally $1 DEF + $2 Shield for $3 turns.": "",
  "Runaway": "",
  "Increase the cap of <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link> to $1 stacks, give additional effect when reaching $2 stacks: Increase DMG Dealt by $3.": "",
  "Give <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies $1 DEF + $2 Shield for $3 turns, and restore $4 SP. When the Shield breaks, decrease your cooldown by $5 action.": "",
  "Preparation time: 8 Actions\\nGive all allies <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield for $3 turns, and restore $4 SP. When the Shield breaks, decrease your cooldown by $5 action.": "",
