  "Preparation time: 8 Actions\\nGive 1 ally <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield, and decrease their Weak DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. Give the target $5 Down Points and $6 stacks of <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link>.": "",
  "Give <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies $1 DEF + $2, increase Shield based on the amount of [Seashell]. If [Seashell] is not below $3 stacks, increase that allies' DMG Dealt for $4 turns. They lose the DMG Dealt buff and $5 stacks of [Nereids's Guard] when the Shield expires or breaks.": "",
  "Preparation Time: 12 Actions\\nGive all allies <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> + <link=\"s|144\"><u>[Seashell]</u></link> stack * (<color=#FFFC40>$3</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>) Shield for $5 turns; If [Seashell] is ≥ $6 stacks, each stack of [Nereids's Guard] increase that allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns; They lose the DMG Dealt buff and $9 stacks of [Nereids's Guard] when the Shield expires or breaks.": "",
