  "S<color=#000000>e</color>ashell": "",
  "r:\"Grant a shield to party equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Miyu's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> for (\\d+) turns, and restore (\\d+) SP\\.\\nWhen an ally's shield is broken, decrease cooldown by (\\d+) action\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"For (\\d+) turns, grant a shield to 1 ally equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Miyu's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> and decrease weakness damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\. Grant (\\d+) Down Points and (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Seashell</u></link> stacks\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Grant a shield to all allies equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Miyu's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> \\+ number of <link\\=(.+?)><u>Seashell</u></link> stacks on party x \\(<color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Miyu's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAlso, if an ally has (\\d+) or more Seashell stacks, increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for each stack\\.\\nThe damage increase effect lasts for (\\d+) turns or until shield is broken, and then lose (\\d+) Seashell stacks\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's stats by (\\d+)% of Miyu's stats\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase shield effect by number of party's <link\\=(.+?)><u>Seashell</u></link> stacks x <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase ally's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for each <link\\=(.+?)><u>Seashell</u></link> stack\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and inflict <link\\=\"s\\|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nRestore Wavecatcher Miyu's SP by (\\d+) \\(this is affected by SP Recovery\\)\\. This skill can restore SP above max SP \\(up to the value of max SP\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Brilliant jellyfish erupt in a dazzling splash, dealing Ice damage to all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. When <link\\=\"s\\|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> is active, for each <link\\=\"s\\|251\"><u>Offshore</u></link> stack, increase this skill's damage by (\\d+)%\\. After activating this skill, remove Surf, and remove all Offshore stacks\\. This skill is counted as a <link\\=\"s\\|100\"><u>Resonance</u></link>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Schools of fish swim in the upward current, dealing Ice damage to all enemies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Remove spiritual ailments from Wavecatcher Miyu, and enter Surf state\\. When this skill is used again while Surf is active, remove Surf and all Offshore stacks\\. On the turn when Surf is removed, other skills can be used, but Surf cannot be re-entered\\.\\nSurf: While this state is active, nullify Down, spiritual ailments, and certain unable to act effects, and Wavecatcher Miyu cannot use melee attacks, ranged attacks, or items\\. Also, extend the duration of buffs and debuffs applied by 1 turn\\. At the end of an ally's turn, if Wavecatcher Miyu has enough SP to activate Catch a Wave, automatically spend SP and activate Catch a Wave\\.\\nCatch a Wave: Spend (\\d+) SP to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and gain 1 Offshore stack\\. For each Offshore stack, increase the skill damage of Catch a Wave by (\\d+)%, and increase the SP cost by (\\d+)\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\. Catch a Wave is counted as a <link\\=\"s\\|100\"><u>Resonance</u></link>, and cannot decrease foes' Down Points\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Head out to sea to catch the perfect wave, removing debuffs and entering the Surf state\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. When in <link\\=\"s\\|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> state, deal bonus Ice damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack (\\d+) time\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During battle, increase Wavecatcher Miyu's Attack based on SP Recovery\\. At a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> SP Recovery, increase Attack up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When <link\\=\"s\\|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> is active, increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.$\"": "",
  "When Miyu grants a shield, grant 1 <link\\=\"s|144\"><u>Seashell</u></link> stack to that ally, up to 6.\\nWhen gaining a Seashell stack, increase shield received by 1% for each stack.\\nWhenever reaching a set number of Seashell stacks, activate the following effects, based on Miyu's level (1/50/70+).\\n2 stacks: Increase Defense by 8%/12%/16%.\\n4 stacks: Increase Attack by 8%/12%/16%.\\n6 stacks: Increase Defense by 12%/18%/24%.": "",
  "At the start of battle, grant party 1 <link\\=\"s|144\"><u>Seashell</u></link> stack.": "",
  "When an ally's remaining HP is below 30%, grant them a shield equal to 28% of Miyu's Defense + 660 for 2 turns. This effect can be activated once per battle.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Little Mermaid's Song and Poseidon's Blessing by 2.": "",
  "When an ally uses a Highlight or Theurgy, grant that ally a shield equal to 16% of Miyu's Defense + 480 for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill level of Tide of Dreams increase by 2.": "",
  "Increase maximum number of <link\\=\"s|144\"><u>Seashell</u></link> stacks to 8.\\nWhen Seashell reaches 8 stacks, increase damage by 20%.": "",
  "Wavecatcher Miyu can enter <link\\=\"s|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> state, spending SP to automatically attack foes.\\nIncrease Wavecatcher Miyu's max SP to 200, and at the start of battle, set her SP to 0. At the start of other allies' turns, restore 15 SP to Wavecatcher Miyu (affected by SP Recovery).\\nDuring battle, based on the total of her recovered SP (including SP above the maximum), gain the following effects.\\n100: Increase Attack by 25%.\\n200: Increase damage by 25%.\\n300: Increase critical rate by 12%.\\n400: Increase critical damage by 24%.": "",
  "Decrease SP cost of <link\\=\"s|250\"><u>Catch a Wave</u></link> by 40%, and increase max <link\\=\"s|251\"><u>Offshore</u></link> stacks by 2.\\nWhen <link\\=\"s|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> is active, extend duration of all buffs/debuffs applied by 1 turn.": "",
  "While <link\\=\"s|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> is active, increase Wavecatcher Miyu's critical damage by 20%.\\nEvery 4 times <link\\=\"s|250\"><u>Catch a Wave</u></link> is activated, activate a special Catch a Wave 1 more time without spending SP. This Catch a Wave does not count toward skill activation counts, and cannot grant <link\\=\"s|251\"><u>Offshore</u></link> stacks.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Paddle Out and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase Wavecatcher Miyu's Resonance damage by 30% for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Jellyfish Splash and Aerial Tide by 3.": "",
  "Increase Wavecatcher Miyu's max SP by 250 more.\\nAt the start of battle, recover max SP, and enter <link\\=\"s|249\"><u>Surf</u></link> state. Also increase max <link\\=\"s|251\"><u>Offshore</u></link> stacks by 2.\\nAdditional effects are added to the following skills.\\nJellyfish Splash: Increase SP recovered when used by 50%.\\nAerial Tide: Surf state is not removed after using this skill, and Offshore stacks are lost after the turn ends. When stacks are lost, recover max SP.": "",
  "r:\"^Grant shield to party \\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.\\\\d+)% of Miyu's Def \\\\+ (\\\\d+), (\\\\d+) turns\\\\), and restore (\\\\d+) SP\\\\.\\\\nWhen ally's shield is broken, decrease cooldown by (\\\\d+) action\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant shield to (\\\\d+) ally \\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.\\\\d+)% of Miyu's Def \\\\+ (\\\\d+), (\\\\d+) turns\\\\)\\\\. Decrease weakness dmg taken by (\\\\d+)% \\\\((\\\\d+) turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nGain (\\\\d+) Down Points and (\\\\d+) Seashell\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant shield to party \\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.\\\\d+)% of Miyu's Def \\\\+ (\\\\d+), (\\\\d+) turns\\\\)\\\\. Increase shield based on target's Seashell stacks\\\\. With (\\\\d+)\\\\+ Seashell, increase dmg\\\\.\\\\nDmg increase lasts (\\\\d+) turns or until shield is destroyed, then lose (\\\\d+) Seashell\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Ice dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\), and inflict Freeze \\(2 turns\\)\\.\\nRestore Wavecatcher Miyu's SP by ([\\d\\.]+) \\(affected by SP Recovery\\)\\. This skill can restore SP above max SP \\(up to value of max SP\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Ice dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. When Surf is active, increase this skill's dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% per Offshore\\. After activating this skill, remove Surf, and remove all Offshore stacks\\. This skill is counted as a Resonance\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Remove spiritual ailments from Wavecatcher Miyu, and enter Surf\\. When this skill is used again while Surf is active, remove Surf and all Offshore\\. On turn when Surf is removed, other skills can be used, but Surf cannot be re-entered\\.\\nSurf: While this state is active, nullify Down, spiritual ailments, and certain unable to act effects, and Wavecatcher Miyu cannot use melee attacks, ranged attacks, or items\\. Also, extend duration of buffs and debuffs applied by 1 turn\\. At end of ally's turn, if Wavecatcher Miyu has enough SP to activate Catch a Wave, automatically spend SP and activate Catch a Wave\\.\\nCatch a Wave: Spend 30 SP to deal Ice dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\), and gain 1 Offshore\\. Increase skill dmg of Catch a Wave by 5% per Offshore, and increase SP cost by 30 \\(max 4 stacks\\)\\. Catch a Wave is counted as Resonance, and cannot decrease foes' Down Points\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Ice dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. When Surf is active, bonus Ice dmg \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk, 1 hit\\)\\.$\"": ""
